notes: Made from tracked-0.22.ecproj with 0.24.1 engine commands (enable Time Remap, a rectangle mask, Gaussian Blur and Roto Brush), its saved analyses replaced by short stand-in strings, and the Warp Stabilizer, 3D Camera Tracker and Roto Brush keys that 0.24.1 computed for it. Written as compact JSON. No media is needed: the tests only check that the keys are kept or cleared.
